@startuml state-reminder
' Диаграмма состояний «Напоминание в outbox» (ADR-0004), рисунок images/state-reminder.png
hide empty description

[*] --> Pending : planReminders / INSERT … ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING (BR-14)

Pending --> Deferred : poll [тихие часы и level ≠ CRITICAL]
Deferred --> Pending : when(конец тихих часов)
Pending --> Skipped : poll [получатель — контрольное лицо и нет согласия]
Pending --> Sending : poll [nextAttemptAt ≤ now] / SELECT … SKIP LOCKED

Sending --> Sent : ok / sentAt := now
Sending --> Retrying : error [attempts < 3] / attempts++
Retrying --> Pending : after(1 | 5 | 25 мин)
Sending --> Failed : error [attempts = 3]

state fallback <<choice>>
Failed --> fallback
fallback --> [*] : [channel ≠ TELEGRAM или level ≠ CRITICAL]
fallback --> [*] : [channel = TELEGRAM и level = CRITICAL] / создать напоминание EMAIL (BR-13)

Sent --> [*]
Skipped --> [*]
Pending --> Cancelled : deadline.markDone
Cancelled --> [*]
@enduml
